POST {{Api_Vapp_HostAddress}}/api/Notifications/mark-read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationId": 1
}

###

### علامت‌گذاری همه به‌عنوان خوانده‌شده
POST {{Api_Vapp_HostAddress}}/api/Notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### حذف اعلان
POST {{Api_Vapp_HostAddress}}/api/Notifications/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

